From 5e957be5a44b391ff933f3dbdbb488c57dc605b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 07:04:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(radio): AJN Audio look and feel in the Radio view +
 Daily Briefing

Radio view only. Rebuilds the flat episode lists as the original AJN Audio
layout (mint theme, hero, Now Playing panel, channel tabs, show/type chips,
sort, search, jump to current, episode cards, news ticker) and adds the Daily
News Digest as a Daily Briefing section.

- Listen now stays on the Radio page (App passes handleAdvanceProgram) and
  plays through the single persistent player; no new media element.
- usePersistentMedia: one hook follows #persistent-player; the mini dock and
  the Now Playing panel both use it.
- GET /api/digest: GitHub Pages digest fetched via safeFetch (host-locked,
  every redirect hop checked), parsed, kept in memory; failures keep the last
  good digest and are reported, never cached as success.
- Freshness is judged by the digest's own last_updated, not the fetch time.
- Tests: test:news-digest, test:radio-view (browser), extended
  test:ajn-radio-catalog; CI steps added.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018yCD8PQZ8hTbVJbiLvPrC4
